                                "sense_id": "326c6713-0cdc-38a0-b0be-f889afd6bb9b",
                                "text": "“Oh, stop your carping, Dawn!” I told myself. “You can't expect charming tones, and Oriental do-dads and apple trees in a German boarding-house.”"
